=== NATURAL ===
DEFINE DATA PARAMETER
1 #RAW_DATE (A8)
1 #FORMATTED (A10)
LOCAL
1 #D (D)
END-DEFINE
MOVE EDITED #RAW_DATE TO #D (EM=YYYYMMDD)
MOVE EDITED #D TO #FORMATTED (EM=YYYY-MM-DD)

=== PYTHON ===
from datetime import date, datetime

class MoveEditedContext:
    def __init__(self):
        self.raw_date = ""
        self.formatted = ""
        self.d = date.today()

def execute_move_edited(ctx: MoveEditedContext, session):
    ctx.d = datetime.strptime(ctx.raw_date, '%Y%m%d').date()
    ctx.formatted = ctx.d.strftime('%Y-%m-%d')
    return ctx

=== EXECUTE ===
- input:
    raw_date: "20260928"
  expected:
    formatted: "2026-09-28"

- input:
    raw_date: "20000101"
  expected:
    formatted: "2000-01-01"
